- templateId: the flash SMS template ID.  
- configId: the flash SMS configuration ID.
- templateContent: the flash SMS content.

> The value of templateContent must be obtained from the corresponding flash SMS capability partner.', example='{"templateId":"104xx","configId":"8037f524-6fxxxxx", "templateContent": "[Outbound Robot] is calling you. Please answer!"}', position='Query'),
  instanceId: string(name='InstanceId', description='The instance ID.

