- **SucceededSpecialInterceptCustomSpecialIntercept**: 31 (Connected - Special interception - Custom interception).
- **HighRiskSipCode**: 32 (Not dialed - High risk, not dialed).', example='SucceededTransferByIntent'),
        taskId?: string(name='TaskId', description='The call ID.', example='ff44709e-39a6-43ba-959b-20fcabe3e496'),
