- When using traditional voices, CosyVoice, or selecting Alibaba Cloud as the custom service, set this to **ali**.
- When using the doubao service, set this to **volc**.
- When using xunfei as the service provider, set this to **xunfei** (can only be used in small model scenarios).
- When using your own service, set this to **dock**, and set NlsServiceType to Authorized.
- When using CV-v3-flash and Qwen voices, set this to **bailian**.', example='ali', position='Query'),
  extParams?: string(name='ExtParams', description='The extended parameter. When Engine is set to **dock**, enter the configuration ID.', example='{"thirdVoiceConfigUuid":"3cd82813ece049c4aff3ea3d***********"}', position='Query'),
  instanceId: string(name='InstanceId', description='The instance ID.

This parameter is required.', example='a8eccb3c-2b26-4b6d-a54f-696b953e33a6', position='Query'),
  nlsServiceType?: string(name='NlsServiceType', description='The service type.
Managed: the default service (public service) of the outbound robot product.
Authorized: the interactive voice response service purchased by the public cloud customer (custom service), configured through system administration > Third-party Voice Configuration.

> When using Alibaba Cloud interactive voice response as the custom service provider, set this to Authorized.', example='Authorized', position='Query'),
