- **HighRiskSipCode**: 32 (Not called - High risk, no call).', example='Executing', position='Query'),
  userIdMatch?: string(name='UserIdMatch', description='The user ID, which is the unique identifier of the user.

> This field is passed when you upload an outbound call list.
